Significance: major
Type: added

Provides a WordPress plugin bootstrap split across an entry file and a below-floor `functions-bootstrap.php`; a single `Component` contract with `Plugin` as the editable component list and a boot loop you can read; a three-rung example ladder — a Gutenberg block, a base-WordPress `Settings` component persisting an option, and a WooCommerce-gated Advanced-tab settings section — with a live uninstall footprint; an example POT; a four-tier PHPUnit suite plus Playwright end-to-end tests; and centralized CI and QA wired to the `a8csp/configs` shared package.
